{
  "version": "1.2",
  "updated": "2026-10-20",
  "author": "c-drive-cleanup-ultimate",
  "note": "清理目标风险登记表。每条规则 = itemid + categoryid + 定制警告 + 延迟确认（delaybtn），结构本身明文可审查、可被用户 --rules 覆盖。匹配方式：Windows 路径小写化后做 glob（* 可跨目录分隔符）。规则自上而下匹配，第一条命中即返回，故 RED 必须排在前面。 | v1.1: 补 project-data/chat-client 规则；条件规则加 scope=file；`dir\\*` 语义支持匹配目录自身（实测 WinSxS 曾被漏判） | v1.2: 微信 4.x 程序缓存(xplugin/radium/log)纳入 GREEN",
  "defaults": {
    "amber_delay_seconds": 8,
    "high_risk_delay_seconds": 15,
    "max_batch": 10
  },
  "levels": {
    "RED": "红线：永不列入清理项，只给建议。block=true",
    "AMBER": "谨慎：必须逐项确认，且确认前强制等待 delay_seconds 秒",
    "GREEN": "安全：纯缓存/可自动重建，可批量（仍走 delete_safe 白名单护栏）"
  },
  "rules": [
    {
      "id": "R0001",
      "category": "personal",
      "level": "RED",
      "block": true,
      "patterns": [
        "*\\desktop\\*",
        "*\\desktop",
        "*\\桌面\\*",
        "*\\桌面",
        "*\\documents\\*",
        "*\\documents",
        "*\\文档\\*",
        "*\\文档",
        "*\\downloads\\*",
        "*\\downloads",
        "*\\下载\\*",
        "*\\下载",
        "*\\pictures\\*",
        "*\\pictures",
        "*\\图片\\*",
        "*\\图片",
        "*\\videos\\*",
        "*\\videos",
        "*\\视频\\*",
        "*\\music\\*",
        "*\\music",
        "*\\音乐\\*",
        "*\\onedrive\\*",
        "*\\dropbox\\*",
        "*\\坚果云\\*",
        "*\\wechat files\\*\\filestorage\\file\\*"
      ],
      "warning": "这是个人目录。删除会丢用户自己的文件，且无法通过任何工具重建。",
      "advice": "只读扫描；如需清理，请用户自己逐条挑选（本技能不代劳）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0002",
      "category": "credential",
      "level": "RED",
      "block": true,
      "patterns": [
        "*\\.ssh\\*",
        "*\\.gnupg\\*",
        "*\\login data",
        "*\\login data-journal",
        "*\\cookies",
        "*\\cookies-journal",
        "*\\key4.db",
        "*\\logins.json",
        "*\\key3.db",
        "*\\signons.sqlite",
        "*\\wallet.dat",
        "*\\microsoft\\credentials\\*",
        "*\\microsoft\\protect\\*",
        "*\\google\\chrome\\user data\\*\\web data",
        "*\\microsoft\\edge\\user data\\*\\web data"
      ],
      "warning": "这里存的是密码/令牌/证书私钥。删除后账号可能永久无法找回（部分无法重置）。",
      "advice": "绝不清理。只提示用户自行管理密码库。"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0003",
      "category": "system-core",
      "level": "RED",
      "block": true,
      "patterns": [
        "c:\\windows\\system32\\*",
        "c:\\windows\\syswow64\\*",
        "c:\\windows\\winsxs\\*",
        "c:\\windows\\servicing\\*",
        "c:\\windows\\boot\\*",
        "c:\\windows\\fonts\\*",
        "c:\\program files\\*",
        "c:\\program files (x86)\\*",
        "c:\\system volume information\\*",
        "c:\\$windows.~bt\\*",
        "c:\\$windows.~ws\\*",
        "c:\\windows\\system32\\config\\*",
        "c:\\windows\\system32\\drivers\\*"
      ],
      "warning": "系统本体或已安装程序。删除会导致系统无法启动或软件损坏，且无法用清理工具恢复。",
      "advice": "系统更新残留只走 DISM / StartComponentCleanup；不直接删文件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0004",
      "category": "pagefile",
      "level": "RED",
      "block": true,
      "patterns": [
        "c:\\pagefile.sys",
        "c:\\hiberfil.sys",
        "c:\\swapfile.sys",
        "*\\memory.dmp",
        "*\\pagefile.sys",
        "*\\hiberfil.sys"
      ],
      "warning": "分页/休眠/转储文件。删不掉（被内核占用），强删会导致蓝屏或无法休眠。",
      "advice": "只能「挪」或「关」：powercfg /h off；虚拟内存改到其他盘。"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0005",
      "category": "message-db",
      "level": "RED",
      "block": true,
      "patterns": [
        "*\\wechat files\\*\\msg\\*",
        "*\\wechat files\\*\\msg\\*.db",
        "*\\xwechat_files\\*\\db_storage\\*",
        "*\\msg3.0.db",
        "*\\msg3.0index.db",
        "*\\wechat\\msg\\*",
        "*\\wechat\\msg*.db",
        "*\\msg\\msg.db",
        "*\\tencent files\\*\\msg*.db",
        "*\\tencent files\\*\\*.db",
        "*\\wechat files\\*\\*.db",
        "*\\appdata\\roaming\\tencent\\xwechat\\*\\db_storage\\*",
        "*\\xwechat_files\\*\\db_storage",
        "*\\xwechat\\*\\message\\*",
        "*\\appdata\\roaming\\tencent\\xwechat\\db_storage\\*",
        "*\\db_storage\\*message*.db"
      ],
      "warning": "聊天记录主库（加密）。删了就没了，没有云端可恢复，联系人会丢历史。",
      "advice": "永不删。只清 Cache/FileStorage 下的缩略图与临时文件，且先备份。"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0006",
      "category": "mail",
      "level": "RED",
      "block": true,
      "patterns": [
        "*.pst",
        "*.ost",
        "*.eml",
        "*.msg",
        "*.mbox",
        "*\\outlook\\*",
        "*\\thunderbird\\*\\profiles\\*",
        "*\\foxmail\\storage\\*"
      ],
      "warning": "本地邮件库。删除后历史邮件（含附件）永久丢失，服务器通常不同步。",
      "advice": "只读扫描；迁移请在邮件客户端内导出。"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0007",
      "category": "source-code",
      "level": "RED",
      "block": true,
      "patterns": [
        "*\\.git\\*",
        "*\\.svn\\*",
        "*\\.hg\\*",
        "*\\node_modules\\*",
        "*\\venv\\*",
        "*\\.venv\\*"
      ],
      "warning": "代码仓库或依赖目录。`.git` 删掉会丢全部提交历史；node_modules/venv 删掉要重装。",
      "advice": "只提示体积；清理必须由开发者自己在项目内操作（git gc / 重装依赖）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0008",
      "category": "encrypted-container",
      "level": "RED",
      "block": true,
      "patterns": [
        "*.vhdx",
        "*.vhd",
        "*.vmdk",
        "*.qcow2",
        "*.vdi",
        "*.bitlocker",
        "*.tc",
        "*.veracrypt",
        "*.dmgex"
      ],
      "warning": "虚拟磁盘/加密容器。删除等于整块磁盘或加密卷消失，数据不可恢复。",
      "advice": "只能迁移（wsl --manage --move / Docker 改 Disk location）或 compact，不能删。"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0010",
      "category": "recycle-bin",
      "level": "AMBER",
      "high_risk": true,
      "delay_seconds": 15,
      "patterns": [
        "*\\$recycle.bin\\*",
        "*\\recycler\\*"
      ],
      "warning": "回收站里有你之前删过的文件。清空后误删恢复的最后一道保险就没了。",
      "advice": "先跑 restore_from_recycle.py --list 让用户看一眼里面有没有有用的东西。"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0011",
      "category": "browser-profile",
      "level": "AMBER",
      "high_risk": true,
      "delay_seconds": 15,
      "patterns": [
        "*\\user data\\*\\history*",
        "*\\user data\\*\\bookmarks*",
        "*\\user data\\*\\extensions\\*",
        "*\\user data\\*\\local storage\\*",
        "*\\user data\\*\\session storage\\*",
        "*\\user data\\*\\indexeddb\\*",
        "*\\user data\\*\\preferences",
        "*\\user data\\*\\favicons*",
        "*\\user data\\*\\top sites*"
      ],
      "warning": "浏览器登录态/书签/扩展/站点数据。删了两个后果：所有网站退出登录，扩展配置丢失。",
      "advice": "只清 Cache / Code Cache / GPUCache / ShaderCache；这些不做。"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0012",
      "category": "app-data",
      "level": "AMBER",
      "delay_seconds": 8,
      "patterns": [
        "*\\appdata\\roaming\\*",
        "*\\appdata\\local\\*"
      ],
      "warning": "应用配置与用户数据。删了软件会重置（要重新登录、重新配置），个别会丢本地数据。",
      "advice": "先 locate_app_caches.py 判断是缓存还是数据；缓存可删，数据只迁移。"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0013",
      "category": "dev-cache",
      "level": "AMBER",
      "delay_seconds": 8,
      "patterns": [
        "*\\pip\\cache\\*",
        "*\\npm-cache\\*",
        "*\\yarn\\cache\\*",
        "*\\.gradle\\caches\\*",
        "*\\.m2\\repository\\*",
        "*\\.cargo\\registry\\*",
        "*\\.nuget\\packages\\*",
        "*\\conda\\pkgs\\*",
        "*\\huggingface\\*",
        "*\\.cache\\huggingface\\*",
        "*\\go\\pkg\\mod\\*",
        "*\\playwright\\*",
        "*\\ms-playwright\\*",
        "*\\.docker\\*"
      ],
      "warning": "开发依赖缓存。删掉能释放空间，但下次构建/训练要重新下载（可能几十 GB、耗时很长）。",
      "advice": "报出体积让用户决定；优先用原生命令（npm cache clean --force / pip cache purge）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0014",
      "category": "wechat-file",
      "level": "AMBER",
      "high_risk": true,
      "delay_seconds": 15,
      "patterns": [
        "*\\wechat files\\*\\filestorage\\*",
        "*\\wechat files\\*\\msgattach\\*",
        "*\\xwechat_files\\*\\msg\\attach\\*",
        "*\\wechat files\\*\\backupfiles\\*"
      ],
      "warning": "微信接收/发送的图片、视频、文件本体。删了聊天记录里点开就是空白，且手机端不一定还有。",
      "advice": "走 wechat_module 四步流水线：盘点→备份真子集→md5 去重→App 内清缓存。"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0015",
      "category": "game",
      "level": "AMBER",
      "delay_seconds": 8,
      "patterns": [
        "*\\steamapps\\*",
        "*\\riot games\\*",
        "*\\battle.net\\*",
        "*\\epic games\\*",
        "*\\tencent games\\*",
        "*\\游戏\\*",
        "*\\saved games\\*",
        "*\\documents\\my games\\*"
      ],
      "warning": "游戏本体或存档。删本体要重下几十 GB；删存档进度直接清零。",
      "advice": "只报体积；缓存目录（如 shadercache）可清，存档绝不碰。"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0016",
      "category": "driver-store",
      "level": "AMBER",
      "high_risk": true,
      "delay_seconds": 15,
      "patterns": [
        "c:\\windows\\system32\\driverstore\\*",
        "*\\driverstore\\filerepository\\*"
      ],
      "warning": "驱动仓库。删错会导致设备（显卡/网卡/打印机）无法识别，甚至进不了桌面。",
      "advice": "只走 pnputil /enum-drivers + /delete-driver，且逐个确认 OEM 包。"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0017",
      "category": "windows-old",
      "level": "AMBER",
      "high_risk": true,
      "delay_seconds": 15,
      "patterns": [
        "c:\\windows.old\\*",
        "c:\\windows.old"
      ],
      "warning": "上一版 Windows 的完整备份。删了就不能「回退到上一个版本」了。",
      "advice": "确认用户不再需要回退再删；或走 磁盘清理→以前的 Windows 安装。"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0018",
      "category": "vss",
      "level": "AMBER",
      "high_risk": true,
      "delay_seconds": 15,
      "patterns": [
        "*\\system volume information\\*"
      ],
      "warning": "系统还原点/卷影副本。删了系统出问题时无法还原到之前状态。",
      "advice": "先 vssadmin list shadowstorage 看真实占用，别按「感觉很大」去删。"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0019",
      "category": "event-log",
      "level": "AMBER",
      "delay_seconds": 8,
      "patterns": [
        "c:\\windows\\system32\\winevt\\logs\\*",
        "*.evtx",
        "*.etl"
      ],
      "warning": "系统事件日志。删了排障时没有线索（蓝屏、驱动崩溃的原因都在里面）。",
      "advice": "只报体积；建议用「事件查看器→清除日志」并先另存。"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0020",
      "category": "prefetch",
      "level": "AMBER",
      "delay_seconds": 5,
      "patterns": [
        "c:\\windows\\prefetch\\*"
      ],
      "warning": "程序预读文件。删了不会坏，但接下来几天开机会变慢（系统要重新学习）。",
      "advice": "收益通常只有几百 MB，不建议为它牺牲启动速度。"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0021",
      "category": "large-file",
      "level": "AMBER",
      "delay_seconds": 8,
      "patterns": [],
      "match_size_mb": 100,
      "warning": "单文件超过 100MB。体积大不等于垃圾，可能是镜像/备份/工程文件。",
      "advice": "用 scan_tiers.py 分档列出，让用户按「1GB / 500MB / 100MB」三档逐个判断。",
      "scope": "file"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0022",
      "category": "backup-file",
      "level": "AMBER",
      "delay_seconds": 8,
      "patterns": [
        "*.bak",
        "*.old",
        "*.orig",
        "*.~*",
        "*\\backup\\*",
        "*\\备份\\*"
      ],
      "warning": "备份副本。/备份/ 目录里可能是用户唯一的副本；.bak 可能是回滚用的最后一版。",
      "advice": "逐项确认，不要因为扩展名像垃圾就批量删。"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0030",
      "category": "pure-cache",
      "level": "GREEN",
      "delay_seconds": 0,
      "patterns": [
        "c:\\windows\\temp\\*",
        "c:\\windows\\temp",
        "c:\\windows\\panther\\*",
        "c:\\windows\\logs\\*",
        "c:\\windows\\softwaredistribution\\download\\*",
        "c:\\windows\\softwaredistribution\\download",
        "c:\\windows\\system32\\codecache\\*",
        "c:\\programdata\\microsoft\\windows\\wer\\*",
        "*\\appdata\\local\\temp\\*",
        "*\\appdata\\local\\temp",
        "*\\appdata\\local\\pip\\cache\\*",
        "*\\appdata\\local\\npm-cache\\*",
        "*\\appdata\\local\\crashdumps\\*",
        "*\\nvidia\\dxcache\\*",
        "*\\nvidia\\glcache\\*",
        "*\\d3dscache\\*",
        "*\\microsoft\\edge\\user data\\*\\cache\\*",
        "*\\microsoft\\edge\\user data\\*\\code cache\\*",
        "*\\microsoft\\edge\\user data\\*\\gpucache\\*",
        "*\\microsoft\\edge\\user data\\*\\shadercache\\*",
        "*\\google\\chrome\\user data\\*\\cache\\*",
        "*\\google\\chrome\\user data\\*\\code cache\\*",
        "*\\google\\chrome\\user data\\*\\gpucache\\*",
        "*\\google\\chrome\\user data\\*\\shadercache\\*",
        "*\\thumbcache_*.db",
        "*\\iconcache_*.db",
        "*\\thumbs.db",
        "*\\appdata\\roaming\\tencent\\xwechat\\xplugin\\*",
        "*\\appdata\\roaming\\tencent\\xwechat\\radium\\*",
        "*\\appdata\\roaming\\tencent\\xwechat\\log\\*",
        "*\\appdata\\roaming\\tencent\\xwechat\\crashinfo\\*",
        "*\\appdata\\roaming\\tencent\\xwechat\\update\\*",
        "*\\appdata\\roaming\\tencent\\xwechat\\xplayer\\*"
      ],
      "warning": "纯缓存：删掉会被系统/应用自动重建，唯一代价是下次启动稍慢。",
      "advice": "可批量，但仍走 delete_safe.py 白名单护栏；≤10 个/批。 微信 4.x 程序数据里的 xplugin/radium/log 等属纯缓存，删除前先退出微信（文件被占用会删不掉）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0031",
      "category": "temp-junk",
      "level": "GREEN",
      "delay_seconds": 0,
      "patterns": [
        "*.tmp",
        "*.dmp",
        "*.log"
      ],
      "match_age_days": 7,
      "warning": "临时/日志/转储文件（且超过 7 天未修改）。",
      "advice": "可批量，但必须排除 QQPCMgr 等杀软保护目录，且受白名单目录约束。",
      "scope": "file"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0009",
      "category": "project-data",
      "level": "RED",
      "block": true,
      "scope": "any",
      "patterns": [
        "*\\.workbuddy",
        "*\\.workbuddy\\*",
        "*\\.claude\\*",
        "*\\.cursor\\*",
        "*\\.vscode\\*",
        "*\\.git",
        "*\\.git\\*",
        "*\\.ssh",
        "*\\.ssh\\*",
        "*\\.gnupg",
        "*\\.gnupg\\*"
      ],
      "warning": "项目/工具链数据目录：含记忆库、技能包、密钥配置、Git 历史。这些是**工作成果**，删了无法通过重装软件恢复。",
      "advice": "永不删。要腾空间请迁移（migrate_with_junction.py），不要删除。"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0024",
      "category": "chat-client-data",
      "level": "AMBER",
      "high_risk": true,
      "delay_seconds": 15,
      "scope": "any",
      "patterns": [
        "*\\appdata\\roaming\\tencent\\xwechat",
        "*\\appdata\\roaming\\tencent\\xwechat\\*",
        "*\\appdata\\roaming\\tencent\\qq",
        "*\\appdata\\roaming\\tencent\\qq\\*",
        "*\\appdata\\roaming\\tencent\\wxwork\\*",
        "*\\appdata\\roaming\\tencent\\wechat\\*",
        "*\\xwechat_files",
        "*\\xwechat_files\\*",
        "*\\wechat files",
        "*\\wechat files\\*",
        "*\\tencent files",
        "*\\tencent files\\*"
      ],
      "warning": "腾讯客户端数据目录：账号配置、消息索引、部分缓存，**可能含聊天记录**。整目录删除会丢历史消息（无云端可恢复）。",
      "advice": "只清 cache/temp 子目录；消息库必须备份。走 wechat_module 四步流水线。"
    }
  ],
  "user_excluded": {
    "note": "项级排除记忆。用户说「这个别清」之后写进这里，下次自动跳过。键为规则 id，值为用户原话与日期。",
    "items": []
  }
}